{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1394,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:195e6bd41e6925559e64e1ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你看看吧！\r\n这是涡轮擅长的月球漫步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab61825e6b424ca2e14d7dbf6e646eac0ef14ae1b6df2156f85b702b4fff2393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6243ed4ccfbdcf14d43a1a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服让涡轮好兴奋呢～\r\n引擎全速运转啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0edfccc7e0c632ec0b3a9bac684ce2b935a8ba73bd90b7ae87dc5366fe79f6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbd99e8fc1d99b6a8ccd8299",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮型态转换！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8c98883cf2382e9775970cd1e5c3f8b027f43a2b5f405c3b0013df62d8aed2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:520bba4756258a62a5525d1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论穿什么，涡轮都是最强的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4904d971a3db7fe6605d32484ce9d0af58d1a0abffb40475cd78a2d2716e1a02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d688207374cb464c0eea961c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27c2c0d352965bd99e5cb301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安，训练员！\r\n很想睡觉吗？那我们来玩鬼抓人吧！\r\n让心脏扑通扑通跳就不会想睡了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c873c2a11cc27793163ac0f895461c54b0b962fb3ec87f3804ffb1f410fef694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac9326835f52e75c46a2c5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮推荐的清醒秘诀是……\r\n去洗把脸！要用非常烫的热水，\r\n或者是非常冰的冷水！",
      "source_fingerprint": "898ef0153bdedc71108594b0ed41dca3aeece7a52e860e5ef597e28969219544",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a20d6c644307b8c74d830bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午了！训练员，到中午了啦！\r\n我们快去大吃特吃一顿，\r\n吃到让肚子变得像气球一样吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8ba37be821200cf25fd21213906d284cde97f8b12b4e199990c9f8fcdc9f5c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad1f5913b3eafddca2e196d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "点心果然就是要吃超甜的那种，\r\n最好甜到爆！像是在松饼上加了\r\n一大堆蜂蜜、糖浆和奶油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5380e277ff320fbd34b49b20c55781a519d6b0d091a45f4410950e8acd175311",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d0a226d5a4c3f27eb57b9f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮在「碰──！」地倒下之前，\r\n都会火力全开！就算在梦里也会\r\n朝着早晨直线冲刺啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd4ee4adb504d766e85eeeb2c331bf3d61954f8c65bf5bb850bbacb2d0edef1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15f02f4449af0d0f6c8bf88a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！涡轮可以挑战\r\n自己能够醒着多久吗？\r\n拜托让我挑战嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b9394b1774c89c4110c8e1465ca88a4a8d2dbd826f2662d033f10b4f8764de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b03a6acb71dcf9348a2d76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的风会咻咻地吹个不停呢！\r\n好，就让涡轮来和它比赛看看\r\n谁的速度比较快～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a4ba94a1fd18ca5f09dfa6c7d906118c64f7c56d7e446ff5c7ed82e286ee9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56c66183bde2fef5b5ee67ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热好热啊～！\r\n不过涡轮可不会输给区区酷热！\r\n训练员！来比赛穿着厚衣服耐热吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9d8b483d6917e4b79707f12aa3924a290682abf6ed4a4dd73d0c44432c7e48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8a8ec12dcabd4d569b60d17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很多落叶飘来飘去对吧？\r\n在秋天结束前，\r\n来比谁能抓住最多落叶吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2297de561717ef62ed08aaf980ea3c8218155af7ae26b5b39c87f8a0b32a03ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4efa69040362ff2494c9987b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来打雪仗吧！打雪仗！\r\n看涡轮狂丢特大雪球把你打成蜂窝！\r\n赶紧来比输赢吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ad9af1d7d9d6fa6b6a89b15ebab10cb930d43fe08fd9d6c1d28f2b1eaddada",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c887a59b70e05d1b547cf0fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ecf5b47698d30d28a83c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "两边的宿舍要合办游戏大赛耶！\r\n这可是关系到挑战最强冠军帝王的\r\n权利呢！涡轮绝～对要赢啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d7048658fa1ed651bf26dc2a28c7fb56ec81b09dc85c06d55ab8085bec52e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e59ed13cd8fa3d74d10144c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮前阵子送了顶有着绿色、蓝色、\r\n粉红色和紫红色的帽子给诗歌剧！\r\n她来找我玩的时候就戴着它呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0dd9bb26be384f5b549903db31af006629a325cc98fa7324e9af143b8a33e5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79fd0f3ced43df1b28a1e468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮跟素质比唱卡拉OK输了。\r\n她说唱歌谣？时的转音？\r\n是必杀技的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63fd0d4f3e2fe9dcced137fcfa89ca8e617b3901b351b4e00f8780915ec821e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25cbdf730aab32be13d6f49c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生野说面对讨厌的食物并全部吃光，\r\n也是一种「比赛」……\r\n涡轮是不会认输的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc47ac41cea6ab1340fa67a389daaaa4953725c52e7e1167322a9331d4aa78a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec28018f25abdcf5a411a4f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果需要竞赛的数据就交给涡轮！\r\n涡轮会迅速透过网络查询哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e1536d323b0276668a6d2a5596eaa8ced5c97256aa0a31e0863eb2c9f6bd2d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9694751b5f11e4b2802701a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要跳舞的话，\r\n果然还是激烈的舞步比较好对吧？\r\n比方说超高速舞步之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "365dbc65fa4c873faea54a7ec2b1d37aa8e36d61e956931ba046af18eef13200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370d1fb3087d0d56f73774e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服穿起来很方便活动，\r\n就算没有音乐也会忍不住跳起舞来！\r\n让人想踏个舞步或来段月球漫步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "007530336bdfac24f687c9c8652dd7e30eebec9f56d766b64fe4d6fef31619b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8216024c4e4e1ad95db7c62d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "内搭变得像赛车服一样！\r\n穿上后感觉可以发挥涡轮的全力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6591cc725eb72b5b54c2aad29c69505edb684476ca87edaad5aa3895877d6146",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26ee9562a7ea756b6acbc0b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这双鞋感觉可以发出喷射气流，\r\n很帅气对吧！\r\n气垫的「反弹力」也很棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fce177eba0307753fd5d32c3d820ac2f7060aac42de35e45afd607df62d35e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77c5a56bdbd440598bff46f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为早餐吃得很饱，\r\n现在燃料全满了！\r\n菜色是～果冻、巧克力加甜甜圈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7761ced2f62c9d9414e03045228ac21f5785da1d5b9374612edde315d09c5ce3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e55f04d5dc1ec4ddfa3bd8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食堂的超辣料理\r\n满足不了涡轮～！涡轮想吃的是\r\n会辣到昏倒的那种辣度！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1c22658f90ad0da342217c59201fb8d97af09bca7d7dc25ea71b768f8b5195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0c3f566412627ce1c986865",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的燃料耗尽了吗？\r\n来跟涡轮玩格斗游戏，\r\n补充一下活力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6616d4bd8b4de48031cb3a2de763052e0a11ec3054f22d2f27e204c838af93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36adbad56bb6343837ea5fc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮和素质她们去赏花了！\r\n还和太阳一起炒热气氛！\r\n用音箱播放爆音音乐──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9425e48605dfa3882bc2f400820690003a4639ce485b2409ab6acab8abafff8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c57cbdc1148534e5e78da48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去海边玩时，又是游泳又是挖隧道，\r\n想做的事实在有太多……\r\n总是不知不觉间就天黑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14695654181ed388b61a8d3c69dd1f2efeb01db0847da7744b30ab321c62020c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff62c5d316964421449f6500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲和运动之秋！\r\n先是涡轮全开运动～再用燃料把肚子\r\n填得饱饱的～一直重复下去～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2272d2b541f585cfa2ea205eca2ea8f3a10955d2c6387b2feb91d1deb06bf5c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a455dc068383b29884b594d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮要盖一个超大的雪屋！\r\n然后和素质她们在里面开火锅派对！\r\n涡轮要带超爆辣的火锅料去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78ca59ba6e85534c1a7dea85838068e33dbbd24d0cde3cf6e589146a78d20ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b99fd2bd9da03fe883811fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的涡轮也是完、全、燃、烧哦！\r\n我很期待哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab8719dfccdd30271e772559b801129ff00772bbe9f8e2b97146f71c800819d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2677b2e32b169af01b71b36c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ターボがんばるよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "addd1eebf5d1b62bd632df3ab13327284383fe8e0fd4cf8a950846ced58dbfc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ea4fd20e83d004abd4e5aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也是涡轮全开～！\r\n涡轮要让赛道上的大家\r\n吓一大跳啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b1a09976f2653b0662551675d8f16920cc9a8c78a000093c04c20068854650",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6794ff6269187732c334e69b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮要努力到燃烧殆尽为止啰～！\r\n训练员，跟着涡轮一起喊「哦～！」\r\n……哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf3a4673b16121a994588b3bd1c870d99f0614f545fa0593478950653fd8090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4fa79072d13f47015784a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮已经等不及啦！\r\n快点快点！快去全力冲刺，\r\n让引擎轰隆作响吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "599f10b15e5c7dd0197399c4f384ba1cc2afc639a550167573bc3f0fdab55ca0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8ab609700fdbdfcfd7f5ab1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮的目标一直都是领先！\r\n毕竟这是训练员想出来的\r\n最强作战嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "299adeb5f90728a8f3e0af4fe38d92a2ed0f7778af5b4349db14e17cb5a50472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6ecbc18a1f53f015f96a28f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是训练也无法阻止\r\n涡轮和你这对搭档！\r\n今天我们也要火力全开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3799e87b50570871b90c7d645eec3f4da35214e7eae56d83a4a2d19224e585c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:995440e65ff6e6d611cb5023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管训练还是竞赛，\r\n我觉得所有的一切都很有趣！\r\n是因为有训练员陪着的关系吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b202a937b2d99fb3dbef8dad3954b1cef9c95ba6d15152a5999fe01b856a488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4c8442ec8ae5d86bc6c564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是大海耶～！\r\n来游泳！打西瓜！挖隧道！\r\n……啊！还有训练哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bb26d3c7f44c1e7ea001e5a420c9a9aac5c33ba3384edbebce244642c765a2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb1a0e9732eea7ed5d4a47ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起的时候啊！\r\n一～直都是涡轮全开哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2df15eaec69fbab2bf1c2b4b0aa3a9ff04b2f67066ce926f0cb01cf6f07fd3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a6d199d8a23df531e76081",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超越极限！连战连胜！\r\n好开心啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7a4a16833edff9210502b446683dc21061a2b813eaf6d1eea4d4c521546152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d67c06c4c06b21ebdfc9ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮引擎，调整完毕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3e638aab24cb0990597643106c56d587257dd1c109d6f9a0b80d524bc40da8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693114d5aa0beb5694bcb326",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了来了来了～！突破极限啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e772ffa1f22adeda1edf61d0f39102e15ccd90859ecb1d97533d2b560c97b2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:befa4d1eaf7a7301bbb457ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双涡轮，引擎全开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc5321c73da399d0fe2d3ade1fe69f0a355561e729ef90c08b4576f511f79c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e644367d15403d8767826354",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿！包在涡轮身上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09d2420cb709aca835580badb33071586828458bc54bb22b8fc4b388b68db747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78e8069a8356e876148a4598",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我告诉你什么叫最强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69206034ccbfd4c71ee86616b733a07e1ed7b72731ea72e7374d21a97d5c4d10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15ea27fe6e29aced8a1a2f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标是获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "414d9cc9e0217a24646342568482f73662e74b9f610102383afcd774e1a93e85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ab8dafcf3b51902f417ede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的梦想并非一朝一夕就能实现。\r\n正因为如此，所以我身边才需要\r\n像你这种不畏艰难的人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e107c10a104d6bbfba00e238d40ba1ffc19df5ff89e0d6f81842f96123460a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22342dae3a8be051081e5143",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行って参ります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4987d3708730ebac0656ffbcb144c2a543ffd8cae52e81662000573920a03aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:622cc5364fb3717b299134d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481ece6b5ae3f39ab09cef14164dcd64ddd6f960e487ca411576688b02f8f52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f098669f92914f708834f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还有很想跟你\r\n一起挑战的事物……\r\n我可以全部照实向你提出吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "518045d82e81a251d0dcb171cb02f75ffd8045355126adc333a5b81e98359cb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd5d9fb7f97469248509ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "捞球跟捞金鱼一样，\r\n诀窍都是「轻轻一捞」呢！\r\n……呵呵，我记起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9ee094de945c387064d01204bb565dc2cd100c6088115e3f0ee00c0e7e2e70b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a97a7c0de8c8427ad739443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n不介意的话要不要一起去新年参拜？\r\n我请人安排了接送车辆喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d82a0f25fa794633bd1a12df16488775c93762cd2026856714714a045358e3b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:389cb521e1a64800dc595d7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向甜点师请教了\r\n巧克力的做法。可以请你\r\n品尝看看我的成果吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "25cdf7531a7d345ad1f84d3bb885b876ed778d885a1fa59d54847d3d98de29c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89104aa24ac33e62ff0b2636",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想还是专业人士的作品更美味……\r\n但我想好好珍惜这份\r\n想制作东西的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02294c2fd86aa804b9bb2eebcdc35e20f78e5b48f099f947489e8aa3672b87a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a955be4c606bea5862cd21a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星星真是美丽……闪闪发光的\r\n彷佛钻石一样。总有一天\r\n我也要像那样闪耀──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b45d2684ced2f74bcf55300c1da3f1d5ea2272f43df2c366a8a9d3ffc50d8153",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3278b84c714f25c70e5c087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……吼吼──！\r\n呵呵，是小北教我这样模仿狼人的。\r\n有吓到你吗？恐怖吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ddbf0f069d8afb1788ab88d8f0b52cc43e792db5186b36b24076ccb611f1ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:831683f3858c86c5ea65fbac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问我可以邀请你\r\n来参加我们集团举办的派对吗？\r\n我会诚心诚意招待你的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a845ff74ced0e9cc45209979c8ea0b7b717ff61036de1ae518cdb8e1dd6dc12a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed2b628367b9c2208fa2a2c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满满的灯饰……！\r\n时间许可的话我想尽量参观！\r\n请问你愿意陪我一起看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "804f7a6235f9fa1c8547e88029e6e729490a191a49b35da4eab62e4e8c5c5bf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42da72fe6ebf6ba6209f765",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6f0e503ebc87dfad6377e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是回顾过去的时期……\r\n该趁现在重新审视一次\r\n反省之处跟待改善之处……嗯嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4fe51cb65bacfb279ee7d2d002a4ab1a0bdf362ec1c341cb8f7da3960f9932e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de8411ae7bbaab855607e4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐♪\r\n在此致赠我家集团经营的\r\n度假村招待券！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b22247c893acf05e663402138c2ea9a1f73bfc677725d3bb7b47d6ab197ba15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b500c5d737e5dc158993bb70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得你生日嘛♪\r\n来挑战你想试试看的事情吧！\r\n请告诉我你想做什么！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96167bd36751da5b1245ce4420e4ad284764af5cf8a1a2af5826eb527d2d4c55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad0e2a8d65a484c5126ff84e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算有所成长，通往目标的路还是\r\n同一条。我该做的就只有\r\n继续达成更大的成就！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3629ce67afda14eb6b95d5854999654c61cc5f5c1392cb675d98b576da6096e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f767e81a5eaaa5cf7a2b50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我生日，我可以稍微\r\n任性一点吗……？我想挑战吃吃看\r\n餐厅卖的整块超辣大蛋糕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "153bdd36957e1757cbeb0b0ec7f64afea78c13e10104376b481f589072280f52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fe52cbfe3e92ec624d2d7ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到新公告了喔。\r\n不知道内容是什么，\r\n我也想看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b108cdbf16d87a2b550335bc9c6e55da28d6a6bb6473548b267eb201f914d809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce9d0e4c57fa5708a995529e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎收到礼物了。\r\n内容是什么呢？要不要确认看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc347213e07cc12256cc721f5ecbab79f111b6b8ee347fa79f6c4e81bce14de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:496ced3b837432e3ee2b201e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成！\r\n保持这个气势\r\n继续下去吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eacbc86b6fecc6b9bb30005fc011ddb770d8aa8a7ef64459c44acc2c5932149a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3260985a6af07b35f505c7bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说活动即将开始！\r\n究竟会发生什么事呢？\r\n真令人兴奋期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e63a83a8e69a2be8f2bd69f296926b105ee9e75c4287f88030730b8e1a50e2e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a9084847b555a915e4ed41d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说活动正在举办中♪\r\n我们也快点去参加吧！\r\n来吧，快快快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0282be66341712adaf4bc0baa4ae7cf23b5157a5ba5fc647bc0c3b8b015c3dce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3593616d90059cff0a9344ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以此经验在下次缔造成果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e8623d6925a5b06987589ec06ddcb971762a939f8fc8842f84e39bdb5816307",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6338f32e1f707cb926ddecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了。\r\n我们也要继续迈向更高的境地！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb0f3ff351e83fd1cb7c9773ce3f22b0eb222746b7d4f4cf5af7860980d750d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e763993f2d38430ebcc7e5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装是妈妈为我挑选的喔，\r\n她说无论穿去什么场合都很适合。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e3a834d894b350461d17954aca2b2ef1fae9a2a0ccd49fd51dd1a10f50e591",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8e758018c686c828dc2f11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小北的衣服很方便行动喔！\r\n我也试着买件外套试看看……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1009472f0d6565ae7abfe01b1cdcd7aa073015a8273e69b0ac93690e9d5e4f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ea07ac185d60c8a90fbe3ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Bonjour！……我的发音如何？\r\n我打算学法文学到\r\n能应付日常对话的程度♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab7a903055b760171264c322e6fa087f025ea157c73feec8f1586a74a883c0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e46ffc23490e7ca3089a9e89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "结果是平手啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e1b2449312a27fec83fe74229e4249cdaead7d767fcc99a4c6b3bd0f5356c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c448f750a79c68c017df4e1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直深信不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fcca7d1cd9524832533eaa51562c88ffc16fd27857179d6c996d5cdf00560cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113698f131b3f2c753c4d4f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以此经验在下次缔造成果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e8623d6925a5b06987589ec06ddcb971762a939f8fc8842f84e39bdb5816307",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "1005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
